      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "One of the worst TW titles I've played. The campaign is just so annoying because instead of making the AI smart, they just make them cheat so AI and player do not play by the same set of rules. \n\n\n\nMeh."
