    {
      "game": "Age of Mythology: Retold Premium Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/17567/450x258/age-of-mythology-retold-premium-edition-premium-edition-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787511600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/17567-buy-age-of-mythology-retold-premium-edition-premium-edition-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "Smooth Operator",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/13734637-1702329179.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "It is a great strategy game and I highly recommend it. The campaign is cool but I had a lot of bugs where the heroes would get stuck meaning restart of the missions ( for campaign ) or the pathing of the troops could ruin the experience ( not bad but janky most of the times).\n\n\n\nThe price is fair for so much content so that is a huge plus in addition to the diversity of content (troops, heroes, upgrades etc.)"
    },
    {
      "game": "Shadow Gambit: The Cursed Crew",
